                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "13189f43-3063-449a-bcd4-02ab93e6bfe3",
                                "sense_id": "e33fbfd5-1e1a-380c-9e2e-44daaa1195da",
                                "text": "From the Johore capital on the island of Pulau Penyengat in the Riau Archipelago, where Parani's brother became \"underking\" to a puppet Malay sultan, the Bugis extended their control over the tin negeri of Kedah and Perak, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9322729e-124f-4360-aa2e-30562908d9c7",
                                "sense_id": "e33fbfd5-1e1a-380c-9e2e-44daaa1195da",
                                "text": "Bede himself used it in this context, among others, referring for example to Peada, Penda's son and the underking of the Middle Saxons, as a princeps."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "859c88ba-db46-4b31-937e-dd1729fd868a",
                                "sense_id": "e33fbfd5-1e1a-380c-9e2e-44daaa1195da",
                                "text": "“I am an advisor in his role as an InterSec director, Lord Guardian, not his counselor as underKing to the Inverni.” Aran made a dismissive gesture with his hand. “A distinction without a difference. [...]”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
